In Section 5.9.1, we identified dispatcher objects as being either **_signaled_** or **_nonsignaled_** . A signaled dispatcher object (such as a mutex lock) is available for ownership. Once it is acquired, it moves to the nonsignaled state. When it is released, it returns to signaled. 
